/**
 * @page hp_type204_guide HP OEM Type 204: HPE ProLiant System/Rack Locator Guide
 *
 * @brief Access HPE ProLiant System/Rack Locator information.
 *
 * @note Experimental: this HP OEM type has not been tested with real hardware
 * dumps.
 *
 *
 * @section hp_type204_selection Result set and ownership
 *
 * @ref lazybiosGetOemHpType204 returns a @ref lazybiosOemHpType204Array_t holding
 * every matching structure. Iterate `entries` using `count`. A non-NULL result
 * whose `count` is zero means the table contains none of this type; NULL means
 * the arguments were unusable or an allocation failed. Release the set with
 * @ref lazybiosFreeOemHpType204, or assign it to `ctx->oem->hp->Type204` and let
 * @ref lazybiosCleanup own it.
 *
 * Every record carries its own SMBIOS `handle` and the reported `length`.
 *
 * @section hp_type204_fields Fields
 *
 * Type 204 exposes the following optional fields:
 * - `rack_name`
 * - `enclosure_name`, `enclosure_model`, and `enclosure_serial`
 * - `enclosure_bays`
 * - `server_bay`
 * - `bays_filled`
 *
 * Check the corresponding `field_status` member before using each field.
 *
 * @see @ref api_hp_type204
 */

/**
 * @var lazybiosOemHpType204Array_t* lazybiosOemHp_t::Type204
 * @brief HP OEM Type 204 structures.
 * @warning Experimental and untested.
 */

